# Build output directory. `upstream/out` is a local junction/symlink that
# points at this machine's absolute path (.temp/upstream-out). It must never
# be committed: it leaks a local absolute path and would pull in gigabytes of
# intermediate build artifacts. Recreate it locally per AGENTS.md if missing.
/upstream/out

# Patch / temp backups left by editing tools
*.orig
*.rej

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
